TITLE 100C pure water pH 3 equilibrium with minerals

SOLUTION 1
    temp    100
    pH      3.0
    units   mol/kgw
    water   1.0

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica          0.0   10.0
    Kaolinite       0.0   10.0
    Dolomite        0.0   10.0
    Epsomite        0.0   10.0
    Fe(OH)3(a)      0.0   10.0
    Halite          0.0   10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           fe_output.sel
    -reset          false
    -totals         Fe(+2) Fe(+3)
    -temperature    true
    -pH             true

END
